WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,180
The divine power was promoted so suddenly

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:03,940
Is it just because I dismantled Huang Yan’s A-level mecha?

3
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:05,700
If you had told me earlier, I would have dismantled it long ago

4
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:07,620
But is this what it feels like to have an A mental power?

5
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:10,140
The power becomes clearer

6
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:12,140
I couldn't tell where I was tired before.

7
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,540
Now it's all gone

8
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:16,500
It doesn’t matter if you feel uncomfortable or not, it’s all normal.

9
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:19,860
Do you feel pain or discomfort anywhere in your head or body? No

10
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:22,300
It's just that he seems a little drifting. That's because he just got promoted.

11
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:24,340
As long as your body doesn't react yet, it doesn't hurt.

12
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:25,780
Because you just upgraded

13
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:26,940
within twelve hours

14
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:33,070
Try not to use your mental power, Sister Tianwei

15
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:37,070
So how are you feeling now? It feels so good, sister.

16
00:00:37,270 --> 00:00:41,140
You are the first Qilin to advance in spiritual power this year. You can pretend to be big.

17
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:43,140
I knew you must think so

18
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:44,300
Let’s not talk about those with food.

19
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:45,780
I'm starving to death because I don't have enough energy.
